# Batman release metadata — the ONLY hand-edited part of the image stamp (#209 S5).
# scripts/stamp-batman-build.sh turns this into files/etc/batman-build at build time and adds what
# must never be typed by hand: the feed and firmware commits, the board, the build date, DIRTY.
# Version rule: docs/VERSIONS.md in winson3QQ/Batman. Bump BATMAN_BUILD_N for every build you keep;
# bump BATMAN_RELEASE per the MAJOR/MINOR/PATCH policy there. One value serves every board.
BATMAN_RELEASE=1.5.11
BATMAN_CHANNEL=rel
BATMAN_BUILD_N=1
BATMAN_MILESTONE=targets v2.0 Build-gate (on 1.x DEV line until gate met)
BATMAN_FEATURES=docker-in-image(#159),memcg,ab-p5,bootstrap-lockdown(#137),confinement-reconciler(#156),ro-containers(#98),generic-payload-manager(#167),payload-guardian-restore(#192),config-seed-onjoin(#202),payload-config-golden,ab-autocommit-v2.2(#211/#209),daily-validation,meshtest-baked,ramoops-baked(#173),firstboot-grow(#201),flashgo-payloads(#159/#216),pi3-ab(#209),one-tree-both-boards(#209),ab-hardening-s5-review(p6-safety,slot-write,autocommit-v2.3),ota-flight-recorder(phase1),explicit-reboot+fw-override-selfcheck,mm6108-rc-null-guard(#245),batadv-24.10-backports(#247,incl.#246),go-toolchain-unified(#252),runc-1.3.6-cves(#247-2),payload-converge-cleanstop(#274),autocommit-recheck-hold(#265/#261),tmp-trust-rundir(#280),payload-guardian-sole-owner(#274)
BATMAN_NOTE=1.5.11-rel.1 release (#289): ots_eud_gateway replaces ots_eud_handler + ots_eud_handler_ssl and the #264 overlay; pin = Batman main 6a049f2 (#295 + #296); same content as 1.5.11-wsl.7 (validated 82 PASS / 0 FAIL on 02+04), channel rel.
